{
  "id": "R4-square-fs-online",
  "about": "as R4-square-fs-offline, online (intro and comments seeded). It records which lists are kept and their offsets; it does not rely on the comment tab's index differing between branches (the near-square branch has no tab view at all), so showRelatedVideo stays the plan's",
